1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
One command, setup, checks this laptop:
Windows 11 · 15 GB RAM · RTX 5060 (8 GB)

2
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Docker Desktop and Ollama are off:
setup starts both and waits for them

3
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,000
4 approved models installed · 0 external
connections · egress firewall applied

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
citadel starts the stack in Docker:
API, worker, sandbox and database

5
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:41,000
Sign in as R. Kulkarni,
process engineering, cleared for INTERNAL

6
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Ask for a report in plain words,
set its classification, press Commit

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
The lead agent takes the task and
recalls 2 memories from earlier work

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,000
It plans on qwen3:4b, locally, in 9.4 s,
and shares its plan and assumptions

9
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,500
Every tool call passes the policy check
and gets a signed receipt

10
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:06,500
2 more documents matched, above her clearance:
withheld from her and from the agent

11
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:12,000
The Task log follows the same task live

12
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:21,500
Built-in evaluation: calls per model,
grounding rate, verification by tier

13
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:28,000
0 external connections · 5 attempts stopped
Policy is data: 8 rules, default deny

14
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Trace and container health: every call timed,
Ollama reachable, every service reporting

15
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:48,000
The five Citadel containers,
running on this laptop

16
00:01:49,000 --> 00:02:01,000
Inference runs on the laptop's own RTX 5060:
no cloud GPU, no API key

17
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:08,000
Draft v1: every paragraph cites its evidence

18
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:12,000
4-tier check: citation fails (the summary
has no source), so v1 stays a draft

19
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,000
The cited source document, page 1

20
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:20,000
A real Word deliverable: classification marking,
sources by page and region, revision history

21
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Memory: what the workbench learned,
access-controlled like documents

22
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Every deliverable keeps its verification
record and its SHA-256 hash

23
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Routing, live: planning → qwen3:4b,
code → qwen2.5-coder:3b, scores shown

24
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,000
0 external connections ·
84 model calls, all local

25
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:40,000
The probe tries to get out:
every attempt blocked and logged

26
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:44,500
Test any decision against the live policy;
every decision joins a hash-chained audit log

27
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:49,500
Revised by the agents: v3 is VERIFIED

28
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:53,000
Now the approver: V. Rangan,
quality assurance

29
00:02:53,000 --> 00:03:00,500
She checks v3's hash, the flagged number
and every source, then downloads the Word file

30
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:09,000
Budgets are hard limits: the agent stopped
at 14 steps, and the verified v3 stands

31
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:12,000
E-101 summary, from a scanned report:
all 4 tiers pass

32
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,500
Still 0 external connections

33
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:35,000
The verified report stays editable:
every change becomes a new verified version

34
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:40,000
One laptop. Its own GPU.
Nothing leaves the building.
